4.11 Lessons Learnt
The project enabled candidates to appreciate that successful poultry production depends on:
•	Proper planning.
•	Good housing.
•	Balanced feeding.
•	Continuous access to clean water.
•	Effective vaccination.
•	Strict biosecurity.
•	Accurate record keeping.
•	Efficient marketing.
•	Teamwork.
•	Sound financial management.
The candidates also learnt that climate-smart practices improve production efficiency while conserving natural resources.
